{
  "uid": "slo-overview",
  "title": "SLO: overview",
  "description": "Single-pane view of every SLO. Each cell shows the 1h SLI; click through to the per-SLO dashboard for burn-rate and budget detail.",
  "tags": [
    "slo",
    "overview"
